# A powerslide too short to count (under slide.minScoreTicks) is no link either: kickflip, land,
# a 4-tick slide tap, then ollie into another kickflip. The tap banks the first Kickflip (100) and
# the second is its own combo. (A tap used to hold the combo open with nothing in it, so the next
# ollie carried it on: Kickflip + Kickflip, and so on for ever; the random farm search found it.)
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+left 96
hold slide 208..212
hold ollie 214..240
tap flip+left 246
run 500
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip,points=100,multiplier=1} count == 2
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip} within 212..214
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip} within 360..364
expect no event bail
